<title>USA: Infu-Tech retains financial consultant.</title>
<headline>Infu-Tech retains financial consultant.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD CLIFFS, N.J. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Infu-Tech Inc said on Monday it had retained BC Capital Corp as a non-exclusive financial consultant to provide advice on strategies, including joint ventures and mergers and acquisitions.</p>
<p>BC Capital is an affiliate of Barber &amp; Bronson Inc, a NASD member firm, the company said.</p>
